{
 "annotations": {
  "list": []
 },
 "editable": true,
 "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
 "graphTooltip": 1,
 "links": [],
 "panels": [
  {
   "title": "{{.WorkloadName}}: Request Rate by Status Code",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 16,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(rate({{.WorkloadMetric}}_count{app=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}[1m])) by (http_response_status_code)",
     "legendFormat": "{{code}}"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 15,
      "stacking": {
       "mode": "normal"
      }
     },
     "unit": "reqps"
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Error Rate (SLO < 5%)",
   "type": "stat",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 16,
    "y": 0
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "(sum(rate({{.WorkloadMetric}}_count{http_response_status_code=~\"5..\",app=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate({{.WorkloadMetric}}_count{app=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}[5m])), 0.001)) or vector(0)",
     "legendFormat": "5xx rate"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": 0.05
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "{{.WorkloadName}}: p99 Latency (SLO < 1s)",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 8,
    "w": 16,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 8
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate({{.WorkloadMetric}}_bucket{app=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}[5m])) by (le))",
     "legendFormat": "p99"
    },
    {
     "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate({{.WorkloadMetric}}_bucket{app=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}[5m])) by (le))",
     "legendFormat": "p50"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     },
     "unit": "s"
    },
    "overrides": [
     {
      "matcher": {
       "id": "byName",
       "options": "p99"
      },
      "properties": [
       {
        "id": "custom.lineWidth",
        "value": 3
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Pods Ready",
   "type": "stat",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 16,
    "y": 8
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"{{.WorkloadNamespace}}\", condition=\"true\"})",
     "legendFormat": "ready"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "unit": "none",
     "color": {
      "mode": "thresholds"
     },
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "red",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": 1
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Memory Saturation (SLO < 85%)",
   "type": "timeseries",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 4,
    "w": 8,
    "x": 16,
    "y": 12
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "prometheus",
    "uid": "prometheus"
   },
   "targets": [
    {
     "expr": "max by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"{{.WorkloadNamespace}}\", container!=\"\"}) / max by (pod) (kube_pod_container_resource_limits{namespace=\"{{.WorkloadNamespace}}\", resource=\"memory\"})",
     "legendFormat": "mem used / limit"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {
     "custom": {
      "drawStyle": "line",
      "lineWidth": 2,
      "fillOpacity": 10
     },
     "unit": "percentunit",
     "max": 1,
     "thresholds": {
      "mode": "absolute",
      "steps": [
       {
        "color": "green",
        "value": null
       },
       {
        "color": "orange",
        "value": 0.85
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   },
   "description": "cAdvisor's container_spec_memory_limit_bytes is absent on k3s and kind, so the limit comes from kube-state-metrics. The PodMemoryHigh alert uses the same expression."
  },
  {
   "title": "Following one request across all three signals",
   "type": "text",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 5,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 16
   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "Metrics say a request was slow. Logs say what it did. Traces say where the time went. The link between them is the **trace_id** `{{.WorkloadName}}` stamps on every access-log line.\n\n1. **Explore \u2192 Loki**: `{namespace=\"{{.WorkloadNamespace}}\"} | json` \u2014 expand a line and click its `trace_id`.\n2. Grafana opens that trace in Tempo. The span tree is the same request the log line described.\n3. Going the other way: pick a trace below, then use **Logs for this span** to land back on that pod's lines.\n\nThe app exports to **Alloy**, never to Tempo. Swapping the trace backend is a change to the collector's exporter alone \u2014 no application redeploy."
   }
  },
  {
   "title": "Recent traces for {{.WorkloadName}}",
   "type": "table",
   "gridPos": {
    "h": 9,
    "w": 24,
    "x": 0,
    "y": 21
   },
   "datasource": {
    "type": "tempo",
    "uid": "tempo"
   },
   "description": "Empty until the app is wired to the collector AND traffic is flowing. A correctly wired app with no requests produces no spans.",
   "targets": [
    {
     "refId": "A",
     "datasource": {
      "type": "tempo",
      "uid": "tempo"
     },
     "queryType": "traceql",
     "query": "{resource.service.name=\"{{.WorkloadName}}\"}",
     "limit": 20,
     "tableType": "traces"
    }
   ],
   "fieldConfig": {
    "defaults": {},
    "overrides": []
   }
  }
 ],
